---
description: Keep agent responses and docs edits short
alwaysApply: true
---

# Concise

- Default to short answers: bullets, steps, no preamble or recap unless asked.
- No apologizing, no "happy to help", no restating the user's question.
- Docs/README/PR text: minimum needed to run the thing; skip architecture essays in chat.
- Code comments only for non-obvious logic.
